{"t":"Steel Helmet Quest","s":"steel-helmet-quest-b664e","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Steel_Helmet_Quest_1_af4431.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Steel Helmet Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Minotaur Tower Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(35 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.61-6.97<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 14, 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A minotaur gang's hideout contains stolen items from Kazordoon.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon%20Minotaurs\">Minotaur Tower</a> west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>,  <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, one or more <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>, possibly <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Horned%20Fox\">The Horned Fox</a> (rare spawn).\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a>, 47 gp, 56 gp, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Fox%20Is%20Out%20%28Book%29\">The Fox Is Out (Book)</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p><i>Note: You may also want to do the <a href=\"#/quest/to-outfox-a-fox-quest\">To Outfox a Fox Quest</a> at the same time, since it is in the same place.</i><br/>\n</p><p>Travel west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> past the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a> and use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">shovel</a> to dig a <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a> hidden behind a <a href=\"#/wiki/Plum%20Tree\">Plum Tree</a> located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32489,31965,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Here (32489, 31965, 7)</a>. You may encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bugs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarves</a>. Once you go down the hole, walk west and rope up into the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon%20Minotaurs\">Secret Hideout</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32466,31966,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32466, 31966, 8)</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"07da696468b3aef9870045d37e1b0d2f\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:140px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steel_Helmet_Quest_1-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:1.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"138\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Helmet_Quest_1_af4431.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steel Helmet Quest 1.jpg (122 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:140px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Secret_Hideout_Route_1-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:138px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Start Rope spot\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Start&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Rope spot' height=\"138\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Secret_Hideout_Route_1_6b96ce.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Secret Hideout Route 1.jpg (49 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Start<br/><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Rope spot</div></div></div>\n<p>Creatures on each of the floors:<br/>\n<b>ground floor</b>: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\n<b>first floor</b>: 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\n<b>floor 2</b>: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a> in each room (north and south rooms)<br/>\n<b>floor 3</b>: North side: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\nSouth side: 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\n<b>floor 4</b>: North side:4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a><br/>\nSouth side: 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mage</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>\n</p><p>The rewards are found in different locations across the hideout.\n</p>\n<ul><li>56 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coins</a> can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20of%20Drawers%20%28Quest%29\">Chest of Drawers</a> next to a table <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32460,31951,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32460, 31951, 5)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Box%20%28Immobile%29\">Box</a> next an anvil <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32461,31947,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32461, 31947, 4)</a></li>\n<li>47 Gold Coins can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20%28Quest%29\">Chest</a> between two beds <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32464,31957,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32464, 31957, 5)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Horned%20Fox\">The Horned Fox</a>'s <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Fox%20Is%20Out%20%28Book%29\">scroll</a> can be found in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20%28Quest%29\">Chest</a> between a bed and a table <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32467,31962,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32467, 31962, 4)</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"c2fd1f063bcbede476df951b94748aeb\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:139px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steel_Helmet_Quest_3-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"137\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Helmet_Quest_3_8c0575.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steel Helmet Quest 3.jpg (97 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:139px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steel_Helmet_Quest_5-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:137px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"137\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Helmet_Quest_5_22346e.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steel Helmet Quest 5.jpg (102 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:139px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steel_Helmet_Quest_2-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:134px; width:185px; top:1.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"137\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Helmet_Quest_2_a6ee97.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steel Helmet Quest 2.jpg (88 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:139px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Steel_Helmet_Quest_4-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:134px; width:185px; top:1.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"137\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Steel_Helmet_Quest_4_5e3eb2.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Steel Helmet Quest 4.jpg (91 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["to-outfox-a-fox-quest"]}